<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman cuts Credit Lyonnais.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman cuts Credit Lyonnais.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it cut its rating on French banking group Crdit Lyonnais to &quot;outperform&quot; from &quot;buy.&quot;</p>
<p>The brokerage said it took the action because the shares had outperformed the market by 43 percent during the past two months.</p>
<p>Lehman said it remained positive on the shares over the long term, and was targeting the FF230 level for the shares.</p>
<p>At 0950, the shares were trading at FF216.9. --London newsroom +44 171 542-5106</p>
</text>
